{
  "name": "Daily competitor Google Ad alerts to Slack",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Daily Google Ad Slack Alerts\n\nRuns on a daily schedule in `monitor` mode. Checks competitor domains on the Google Ads Transparency Center and posts a Slack message whenever a competitor launches a genuinely new ad.\n\n## Setup (once)\n\n**1. Get an Apify token** — https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations\n\n**2. Create the n8n credential**\nCredentials → New → **Header Auth**\n- Name: `Apify API`\n- Header name: `Authorization`\n- Header value: `Bearer YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN`\n\nEvery HTTP node here points at that credential by name. No token is stored in this file.\n\n## Why monitor mode doesn't flood Slack\nGoogle sorts ads by last-shown date, which causes old ads to resurface constantly. This Actor anchors on `firstShown`, so only genuinely new creatives trigger an alert (~0.4 ads per domain per day).\n\n## Cost\n\nPay-per-event: from $0.70 per 1,000 ads returned ($0.0012 on Free down to $0.0007 on Gold) plus $0.01 per competitor checked in monitor mode. Only ads genuinely new (judged by Google firstShown date) are returned.\n\nCurrent pricing: https://apify.com/sumitr_mardy/google-ads-monitor/pricing\n\nActor: https://apify.com/sumitr_mardy/google-ads-monitor\nTemplates & docs: https://github.com/sumitrmardy/google-ads-monitor-api",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "t1-sticky",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -120,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "daysInterval": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "t1-schedule",
      "name": "Daily Schedule Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        320,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/sumitr_mardy~google-ads-monitor/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"targets\": [\"hubspot.com\", \"zoom.us\"],\n  \"mode\": \"monitor\"\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000
        }
      },
      "id": "t1-check",
      "name": "Check competitor ads (Apify)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        560,
        100
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "apify-api",
          "name": "Apify API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "bc19dbf6-068e-4ef9-b4b9-5a17391518bc",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.creativeId }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "t1-filter",
      "name": "Filter new ads",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        800,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "#competitor-ads",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "text": "=🚨 *New Google Ad Detected for {{ $json.target }}*\n*Advertiser:* {{ $json.advertiserName }}\n*Format:* {{ $json.format }}\n*Headline:* {{ $json.headline || 'N/A' }}\n*Description:* {{ $json.description || 'N/A' }}\n*Link:* {{ $json.adUrl }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "t1-slack",
      "name": "Send Slack Alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1040,
        100
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "slackApi": {
          "id": "slack-bot",
          "name": "Slack Bot"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Daily Schedule Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Check competitor ads (Apify)",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Check competitor ads (Apify)": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Filter new ads",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Filter new ads": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Send Slack Alert",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  }
}
